  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Good journey** = the synthetic client got an order ID, the order reached *fulfilled* within **5 s**, the shipped SKU equals the SKU it *remembers* requesting, and the payment simulator's own ledger shows **exactly one** successful capture of the right amount. HTTP 2xx alone is not success. Each journey is judged once, at completion or at the deadline (still pending = bad). Declined-card and bad-quantity probes are validation checks, outside the SLI. SLO: 99% (illustrative). Start here, then follow a bad journey's trace."
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 1,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   },
   "id": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "SLI over the dashboard range",
   "description": "Good / eligible journeys in the selected time range.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "sum(increase(webshop_synthetic_journeys_total{webshop_outcome=\"good\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(webshop_synthetic_journeys_total[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "__auto",
     "refId": "A",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 0.99
       }
      ]
     },
     "decimals": 2
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
